<h2>Same Day Polar Fridge Repair London for Restaurants, Hotels &amp; Takeaways</h2>
<p>ColdDirect provides 24/7 same day Polar Fridge Repair London across all London boroughs. We repair commercial refrigeration for restaurants, hotels, pubs and takeaways, with a fast emergency response when food stock is at risk. An engineer diagnoses on site and gives a clear price before work. Genuine parts are fitted where they match the model. Call 07983 759320, 0800 112 3427 or 0203 952 4822.</p>
<p>Polar catering fridges and freezers used in restaurants and takeaways are repaired independently. We diagnose the model on site and price the work after inspection. This is not an official Polar warranty centre claim. Coverage includes Barnet, Enfield, Haringey, Wembley and Greater London. Tell us the make, model, serial plate, postcode and whether the site is open, in service or closed. Same-day attendance depends on location and workload and is confirmed when you call. ColdDirect does not repair domestic household fridges or freezers.</p>
<p>When you book Polar Fridge Repair London, describe whether the fault started after a delivery, during a hot kitchen service or after a power cut. Those details help the visit. Keep using your own temperature checks and stock procedures until the engineer has finished. All jobs come with warranty on the agreed work. We are commercial specialists only.</p>
<h3>Common Faults We Fix</h3>
<ul>
<li>Polar cabinet warm, alarming or not starting</li>
<li>Ice on the Polar evaporator or blocked drain</li>
<li>Door gasket or hinge wear on a Polar fridge</li>
<li>Controller, probe or compressor fault on Polar catering plant</li>
<li>Not cooling / warm product, ice build-up, and compressor failure after diagnosis</li>
</ul>
